red_sha256":"46157dd55ff5955642535ba35ea2e04bde1667fd990255f0e22502ac7e4efaa2"},"seconds":68.53684496879578,"seed":975103034946714126,"stop":"eos","text":"To solve for \\(x_{531} + x_{753} + x_{975}\\), we first need to understand the recurrence relation given: \n\\[x_n = x_{n-1} - x_{n-2} + x_{n-3} - x_{n-4} \\text{ for } n \\geq 5.\\]\nWe start by calculating the first few terms of the sequence to identify any patterns.\n\nGiven:\n\\[x_1 = 211, \\quad x_2 = 375, \\quad x_3 = 420, \\quad x_4 = 523.\\]\n\nNow, we compute the next terms:\n\\[x_5 = x_4 - x_3 + x_2 - x_1 = 523 - 420 + 375 - 211 = 267,\\]\n\\[x_6 = x_5 - x_4 + x_3 - x_2 = 267 - 523 + 420 - 375 = -101,\\]\n\\[x_7 = x_6 - x_5 + x_4 - x_3 = -101 - 267 + 523 - 420 = -265,\\]\n\\[x_8 = x_7 - x_6 + x_5 - x_4 = -265 - (-101) + 267 - 523 = -420,\\]\n\\[x_9 = x_8 - x_7 + x_6 - x_5 = -420 - (-265) + (-101) - 267 = -423,\\]\n\\[x_{10} = x_9 - x_8 + x_7 - x_6 = -423 - (-420) + (-265) - (-101) = -167,\\]\n\\[x_{11} = x_{10} - x_9 + x_8 - x_7 = -167 - (-423) + (-420) - (-265) = 267,\\]\n\\[x_{12} = x_{11} - x_{10} + x_9 - x_8 = 267 - (-167) + (-423) - (-420) = -101.\\]\n\nNotice that \\(x_{11} = x_5\\) and \\(x_{12} = x_6\\). This suggests a periodicity in the sequence with a period of 6. To confirm, we compute a few more terms:\n\\[x_{13} = x_{12} - x_{11} + x_{10} - x_9 = -101 - 267 + (-167) - (-423) = -265 = x_7,\\]\n\\[x_{14} = x_{13} - x_{12} + x_{11} - x_{10} = -265 - (-101) + 267 - (-167) = -420 = x_8,\\]\n\\[x_{15} = x_{14} - x_{13} + x_{12} - x_{11} = -420 - (-265) + (-101) - 267 = -423 = x_9,\\]\n\\[x_{16} = x_{15} - x_{14} + x_{13} - x_{12} = -423 - (-420) + (-265) - (-101) = -167 = x_{10}.\\]\n\nThus, the sequence is indeed periodic with a period of 6. Therefore, we can express the terms as:\n\\[x_n = x_{n \\mod 6}.\\]\n\nNow, we need to find \\(x_{531} + x_{753} + x_{975}\\):\n\\[531 \\mod 6 = 3 \\implies x_{531} = x_3 = 420,\\]\n\\[753 \\mod 6 = 3 \\implies x_{753} = x_3 = 420,\\]\n\\[975 \\mod 6 = 3 \\implies x_{975} = x_3 = 420.\\]\n\nThus, the value is:\n\\[x_{531} + x_{753} + x_{975} = 420 + 420 + 420 = 1260.\\]\n\nThe final answer is:\n\\[\\boxed{1260}.\\]"},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{1260}","correct":false,"format":"boxed","parseable":true}}
